    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Could you also go into more detail about how pH levels influence the reaction? Specifically, I'm looking at how an alkaline environment vs an acidic one affects the nucleophilicity of the amino group and the overall rate of browning.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
